# pstack model configuration for GitHub Copilot CLI.
#
# Every pstack skill reads this file explicitly ("use X from ~/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc
# when present"), so it works under Copilot even though Copilot never auto-applies .mdc rules.
# The path is kept as-is so no upstream skill needs editing.
#
# Values below are plain Copilot model slugs, valid as-is for the Task tool's `model` field.
# Copilot separates model from reasoning effort, so effort is a SEPARATE table at the bottom —
# never append it to a slug here.
#
# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: omit Task `model` and run on the parent chat model.
# Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.
# Delete a line to fall back to the skill's inline default.

feature, refactoring: grok-4.6
bug-fix: gpt-5.6-sol
perf-issue: gpt-5.6-sol
hillclimb: gpt-5.6-sol
judgment and prose: claude-opus-4.8
hardest tasks: claude-opus-4.8
how explorer: grok-4.6
how explainer: claude-opus-4.8
how critics: claude-opus-4.8, gpt-5.6-sol, grok-4.6, claude-opus-5
why investigators: grok-4.6
why synthesizer: claude-opus-4.8
reflect tooling: gpt-5.6-sol
reflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer: claude-opus-4.8
arena runners: claude-opus-4.8, gpt-5.6-sol, grok-4.6, claude-opus-5
arena cross-judge pool: claude-opus-4.8, gpt-5.6-sol, grok-4.6, claude-opus-5
swarm workers: grok-4.6
architect runners: claude-opus-4.8, gpt-5.6-sol, grok-4.6, claude-opus-5
interrogate reviewers: claude-opus-4.8, gpt-5.6-sol, grok-4.6, claude-opus-5

# Reasoning effort, passed as the Task tool's separate `reasoning_effort` field.
# Match the role above to a row here. Omit the field when a row is absent.
#
# role class                          | reasoning_effort
# ------------------------------------|------------------
# judgment, prose, hardest tasks      | max
# review panels (how, arena,          | high
#   architect, interrogate)           |
# bug-fix, perf-issue, hillclimb      | high
# feature, refactoring                | high
# swarm workers, why investigators    | medium
# mechanical / report-only work       | low
#
# claude-haiku-4.5 does not accept reasoning_effort. Omit the field for it entirely.
